🔢 Day 34: Prime Number Checker + List Primes in a Range

📌 Project Overview

This is my Day 34 Python project, where I learned how to check whether a number is prime and find all prime numbers within a given range.

The program uses two functions, is_prime() and primes_in_range(), to organize the logic and make the code reusable. A menu allows users to check individual numbers, list prime numbers in a range, or exit the program.

This project helped me practise functions, for loops, return, if-else conditions, lists, and menu-driven programming.

